# Backend testing

- Tests: Jest via `npm test` (`jest --ci --runInBand`).
- Specs live under `tests/` by domain (e.g. `tests/auth/login.test.js`, `tests/urls/url.test.js`).
- Do not remove existing tests. Extend them.
- Cover the behavior you changed, plus the obvious failure path (validation error, unauthorized, not found).
- Prefer isolated tests; do not hit production Mongo or external SMTP. Use test env / mocks as the suite already does.
- Optional: `npm run test:report` for a generated report; `npm run db:ping` for connectivity checks.

```javascript
// ❌ BAD — deleting a failing test to ship
// ✅ GOOD — extend tests/auth/login.test.js with the new case
```
